file docs-geode/study/README.md the third habit, read the name; and two claims measured rather than repeated -- fifty-odd pages is 83, and most-cited room is false at 12.4 inbound per page against context/ at 36.4
file docs-geode/demos/README.md a fifth demo running the mark meter, two drifted outputs re-run, and a closing paragraph that names what drifted and when
file docs-geode/wiki/README.md both new edges recorded, since a page absent from this table is one the shelf has yet to admit
file docs-geode/README.md the demos row follows the fifth demo, and the front door normalized to ASCII -- 15 non-ASCII lines to zero, with the superscript exponent restored as 2^4 rather than read as twenty-four
file foundations/README.md seven council-rota foundations seated, so all twelve the rota reads are reachable from their own door
file tools/fixtures/a/announced_length_scan.sh the exclusion extended to this meter's own output shape, in the family its comments already document three times
file tools/fixtures/a/announced_length_control.sh four cases, both sides -- a quotation reads clean, a bare announcement beside it still bites
file construction/REDS.md %436 booked and closed on a witness, number read from the fetched anointed spine
file construction/ITINERARY.md the booked lap marked landed, the 26 unindexed foundations left open, within the 32,768 bound
recommend check-in Keaton -- the 26 remaining unindexed foundations want a lap of written meaning clauses, and this lap produced fresh evidence for the OPEN %430 question he has yet to rule on
